  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GEF EO has started a virtual community of practice that will create, validate and disseminate evaluation information and knowledge. GEF EO will act as moderator, organizer and initiator for this  initiative, and provide a basis for funding and for studies and meta-evaluations on climate change adaptation/mitigation. Sida provides core funding for the initiative.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Global Environment Facility Utv&#xE4;rderingskontor har startat en virtuell, internet-baserad gemenskap som ska skapa, validera och sprida utv&#xE4;rderingsinformation och kunskap kring klimatf&#xF6;r&#xE4;ndring. GEF EO agerar som organisat&#xF6;r f&#xF6;r denna insats och ger en bas f&#xF6;r finansiering f&#xF6;r studier och meta-utv&#xE4;rderingar. Sida ger allm&#xE4;n finansieringen f&#xF6;r insatsen.</narrative>
  </description>
